      "possibleRetry": false,
      "inputTokens": 49,
      "outputTokens": 349,
      "costUsd": 0.0031655,
      "pronunciationText": "One trap to avoid. The median comes from F, not f. Setting x over eight equal to a half gives four, which is just the end of the domain. The height of the density has nothing to do with half the area."
