      "outputTokens": 739,
      "costUsd": 0.0066995,
      "pronunciationText": "Expand f, and its derivative is twenty four x minus thirty six x squared, or twelve x times two minus three x. That's zero at x equals zero, and at two thirds. But f of zero is zero, the lowest value, and f is zero at x equals one too. At two thirds, f is sixteen ninths, its greatest value. So the mode is two thirds. Zero is wrong. It's a stationary point, but a minimum."
